  "description": {
   "en": "Midori, a corporate slave, is being worked to death day and night. Her meals come from the convenience store, her refuge is alcohol and cigarettes, and she goes home only to sleep - such are the utterly wasteful days she leads. On her way home one day, she discovers a girl sleeping in the dumpster. She helps the girl on a whim, who introduces her self as Airi, a **witch**(!) with mysterious powers. Airi begs her, \"Please let me stay with you for a while\", and so begins their strange cohabitation life!? Warm and fluffy relief has arrived to Midori's weary days. These two mismatched ladies, a corporate slave office worker and a mess of a witch, begin their cohabitation life! (Translated from BookWalker)",
   "ja": "社畜系ＯＬ・みどりは昼も夜も仕事に忙殺され、ご飯はだいたいコンビニ弁当、癒しはタバコとお酒、家に帰っても寝るだけという超絶荒んだ日々をおくっていた。ある日の帰宅途中、ゴミ捨て場で寝ている女の子を発見。気まぐれで助けるも、不思議な力を使い\"魔女\"（！）だと名乗るその女子・アイリに「しばらく家に置いてほしい」と懇願され奇妙な同居生活をおくることになり……!?"
  },
